          "summary": "Corio owns Developments outright; licence-back for embedded Commerce One IP; no joint ownership; Corio retains all rights in its data",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We delete Commerce One's ability to take ownership of Developments created solely by Corio, add a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free licence to any Commerce One materials embedded in those Developments, confirm the parties will not jointly own IP, and confirm Corio retains all rights in its and its Customers' data with Commerce One limited to processing it solely to provide the services. This is our preferred IP position.",
          "ops": [
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0115",
              "oldText": "shall be owned by Corio, unless such Developments are supported on an ongoing basis by Commerce One in which case Commerce One will retain all ownership rights, including",
